161:Now's the time to start bidding. Since it sold for 6.5 million Coppers before, 8 million Coppers is already in the bidding range. It'll only become riskier and more people will start competing if the price drops further. I decisively raise my number plate. The auctioneer looks at me and starts calling out the bid after nodding at me.
